{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "89ec0d3afb5805156fe0c5d236c69a08f8e3d3babdec9eb769eeb656b3cc3019", "ja": "心はいつも大和撫子！なのです", "zh": "常保大和抚子之心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "63f570ba50f3228fffcb5bb78dc7de4239fae6537b9ba83f3c9255d3200f7dd6", "ja": "美咲から作成中の衣装を見せてもらうまつり\nとエミリー。フリルたっぷりの衣装が心配な\nエミリーだったが、ユニットのために行動\nするまつりを見て、姿形でなく、相手を思う\n気持ちこそが大和撫子らしさだと気付く。", "zh": "美咲向茉莉和艾蜜莉展示做到一半的服装。\n虽然艾蜜莉对充满荷叶边的服装\n感到担忧，但看着为团体而行动的茉莉，\n她注意到大和抚子最重要的不是外在，\n而是替对方着想的心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "99948c393c433db38d633ed50162252c839cafce6dc22144570962bb90a04bfd", "ja": "（お姫様講座で亜美と真美のアドバイスを受けた結果、\nエミリーがちょっと悩んでしまったみたいだ……）", "zh": "（在『公主讲座』听了亚美和真美的建议后，\n艾蜜莉好像有点苦恼……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "57ef4819fbb0180f27aecdbd1004371bd60f244817044199593a70b30123643a", "ja": "いつも一緒にいること……それだけで本当に、\n亜美さんと真美さんのようになれるのでしょうか？", "zh": "形影不离……这样真的就能\n变得像亚美和真美一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3f280e0ae727bceab4a71dfc2ed2d78cb29905aa5c948a37d62aa737e52210a9", "ja": "ふたりとも、ノリで言ってたような気もするし……\nそこまで真剣に受け取らなくていいと思うけどな。", "zh": "她们也可能只是随口说说的……\n我觉得不用那么认真啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "416466a06e1d3050d9680cd3c608f1b42f8e9dec8213090baf03ddce0486f9f8", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、エミリーちゃん。\nそろそろ、レッスンに行くのです。", "zh": "小艾蜜莉、小艾蜜莉，\n差不多该去训练了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "37d26f8104b203838a706980c8633f2b9dbd8c0361535d70652453c5f888aee3", "ja": "あ……はいっ、まつりさん。\nおふたりの心得を、まずは実践ですよね！", "zh": "啊……好的，茉莉。\n要先实践两位说的要领对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "98ffb35a30970e491ff809a80946376632fd50f8f25d6c1695175a2de3839fa1", "ja": "それだけではないのです。\nレッスンのあとは、お茶会を開くのですよ。", "zh": "不只是这样的喔，\n训练结束后，还要举办茶会的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "c07a39c96c5ed1f93adadb924f64fc223573da86ab1836f63f31a78a1c1941d2", "ja": "それは素敵ですね！\n私、とっておきのお抹茶を持ってきます！", "zh": "真是太好了！\n那我要带特别的抹茶过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "d013cff0c8c3dc5f6c354225317e4de8d7ae3f7b1b1f3abb28d1da9835225b92", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん……あっ、\nまつりちゃん、エミリーちゃん、ちょうどよかった！", "zh": "{$P$}先生～\n啊，茉莉、艾蜜莉，正好你们也在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4f48fd17477c393ed04ad50f710442c1089c3aacf1c5c34de8678786934efbb0", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\nどうかしたんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "59db1e7930e3eac815be976e8c19a69e3d7a8c538f11689cbd07aca0dea80094", "ja": "えへへっ、実は～……。\nふたりの衣装の、仮縫いが完成したんです！", "zh": "嘿嘿，其实呢～\n我做好两位服装的假缝版了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e75962b5a3a01030f81589975fa37deaf1341882ed13c26dc132f0bce665a08b", "ja": "えっ！？　もうですか、早いですね。", "zh": "咦！？已经做好了吗？好快喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "bb4f5c630cf2b278c19210e954a5049dee56858de88dd8d3cf5027ac0c715130", "ja": "はい、得意なジャンルだったので♪　ふたりにも\nちょっと見てほしいんですけど、いいですか？", "zh": "是的，因为是我擅长的领域♪\n我想让两位也看一下，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "4ef131a392f293692309631d9d35047c9d2896f70e72c326f886ee1af395405a", "ja": "もちろんなのです！\nエミリーちゃん、見せてもらいましょー！", "zh": "当然的喔！\n小艾蜜莉，我们去看吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "28740e767d927a3fa7008006beebd5993dd33dc911635fb5cd609a67b09acfc2", "ja": "こんな感じなんだけど、どうかなぁ？\nフリルたっぷりの、甘めなデザインにしてみたんだ♪", "zh": "差不多是这种感觉，怎么样？\n我试着用了充满荷叶边、甜美可爱的设计♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "fd297a69281293cbb37ed51a6cc751ccd56ac70b5d3e0f9000734f11f7888506", "ja": "これは……わんだほー！　ふわふわであまあまな、\n双子のお姫様にぴったりの衣装なのです。", "zh": "这真是……太美妙了！轻飘飘又甜蜜蜜，\n是跟双胞胎公主一拍即合的服装喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "5d472a93afdee159b3dfd6b68fb8a9c2044b337efd12cc432b7ed3bb62a3ca27", "ja": "美咲ちゃん、ありがとうなのです！\n素敵な衣装ではっぴー！なのですよ♪", "zh": "小美咲，谢谢你的喔！\n能穿上这么棒的服装，公主好开心的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "d159b1139fd8c83e13c4a51cd91750824628ee6763ffbcc47497480dccffd09f", "ja": "そんなによろこんでもらえると、私もうれしいなぁ♪\nしっかり仕上げるから、楽しみにしててね！", "zh": "看你这么喜欢，我也好高兴喔♪\n我会好好完成的，敬请期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0293138aaf6ca33fc6876708c68f5d4943695dee0390658e5bfc162f51e9bfc4", "ja": "エミリー？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "艾蜜莉？你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "89210ed5ebbdf912cb76c3b3af68f57324f6c3f9ec73fdf3a2712a3b471b206e", "ja": "はっ！？　は、はい！\nええと……す、素晴らしい衣装ですね！", "zh": "啊！？是、是啊！\n我想想……真、真是好看的服装呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "4de2c43351bb863330fde1f2cd01532e5a8dc21d80a5c45fbb3e790a895a7f5e", "ja": "エミリーちゃん。気になることがあるのです？\n様子が変なのですよ。", "zh": "小艾蜜莉，你有什么疑惑吗？\n你看起来怪怪的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "f78e85d6e235d472fcae6a6753550727f9b12d20f99fee3ae218c03e5bc83e3d", "ja": "い、いえ！　本当に、素敵な衣装だと思います……。\n本当に……。", "zh": "没、没有！我真的觉得服装很漂亮……\n真的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d69ee10e0ba314f5ab33099f66c9e8cad01e8ca3ae26cb8e7c4853c5296b405e", "ja": "エミリー、言いたい事があるなら、\nちゃんと言ってくれた方が助かるよ。", "zh": "艾蜜莉，如果有话想说，\n还是说出来比较有帮助喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "e0bcc35c2581e19414ccf56455a3e436b564bce8323a175a1a9e6720f742b891", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……私……。\nこの衣装は、本当に素敵だと思います。", "zh": "策划执行人先生……我……\n我真的觉得这套服装很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "11b05492ecf60e3bfe1120e7e92e3e660518d3ceb3ae44c04d0a317c0b3c0d9f", "ja": "でも、自分が着ている姿を想像したら……。なんだか、\nほ、本物の西洋人形みたいになってしまいそうで……。", "zh": "但一想到自己穿上的模样……\n总觉得会变得像真、真正的洋娃娃一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "59cb7c0a5182286bfb6e05faba410a8a6d3e7d3357651a1c0bee74f389d72705", "ja": "エミリー……。", "zh": "艾蜜莉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "d152402563a30898c94270a8b9a90e8fb0de47e88b488dd649e5e82e9147d3b6", "ja": "エミリーちゃん。大和撫子というのは、\n見た目だけのものではないのですよ？", "zh": "小艾蜜莉，所谓的大和抚子，\n并不只是从外表判断喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "e4f7e39c6d62b07140fa4a05f2e13ac235a26cdad800fe8e9551d8ecd54ce3cb", "ja": "大和撫子はいるのです。\n姫にも、もちろんエミリーちゃんの心にも……。", "zh": "我们心中都有大和抚子的喔，\n公主心中有，小艾蜜莉心中当然也有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "49b15408e4cb63cf193bee4fc81969b03a5b15108e27633359c1dee29eb92b6c", "ja": "人の数だけ、大和撫子の姿はある。\n姫は、そう思うのですよ……。", "zh": "有多少人，就有多少大和抚子的面貌，\n公主是这么认为的喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "9f800644672f48a3f687c98c836187bd1ba3e21b945f2d7f24028760d921b427", "ja": "え？　あ、あの、まつりさん……？", "zh": "咦？那、那个，茉莉……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1031_021mat", "source_sha256": "46ea32ed00c92c934c898d6eea6f4021fe3e7ec7bf156304bc57429e7b8e3f0a", "ja": "ちょっと美咲ちゃんのところに行ってくるのです。\n{$P$}さん、あとはまかせたのです！", "zh": "公主去找一下小美咲的喔，\n{$P$}先生，接下来交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1032_032emi", "source_sha256": "fad007d7a83afb51c48f211f1769c35258e524af4cf76e3c440ef4d66639dae5", "ja": "あの……仕掛け人さま。今のはいったい、\nどういう意味なのでしょうか……？", "zh": "请问……策划执行人先生，\n刚刚那到底是什么意思呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "802a7df43e370fa2287ff259925cbe1b56fd569f9a41aa7358812b8355be82ef", "ja": "そうだな、あまり上手く言えないけど……。\nまつりを見ていると、なんとなくわかる気がするよ。", "zh": "这个嘛，我也不太会说……\n但看着茉莉，总觉得就能理解了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1034_032emi", "source_sha256": "8210382ee61b679cd4083e3b39e3779ab90709f2663dab5e79c790e5a8915c60", "ja": "まつりさんを……？", "zh": "看着茉莉……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1035_021mat", "source_sha256": "024879df99d611689cd493e6d6216d7dd1a712c31df23aea772163fdd51f5513", "ja": "美咲ちゃん。まつりの衣装の袖、\nもうすこしだけ詰めてほしいのです。", "zh": "小美咲，\n茉莉希望能把服装的袖子改短一点的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1036_102mis", "source_sha256": "5235701917672ee7afaac512ff41f4837e4a09baa85784f4271e605cab24bb79", "ja": "まつりちゃんの袖だね。\nえっと、これくらいでいいかな？", "zh": "你的袖子对吧？\n我看看，差不多像这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1037_021mat", "source_sha256": "738040bdfbc03ea52c4a8de48d2b7d1f4ecaad64f517516b6ffb4306ba8b4f8d", "ja": "ぶらぼー！なのです。\n美咲ちゃん、さすがなのです。", "zh": "太棒了喔！\n真不愧是小美咲的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1038_021mat", "source_sha256": "2a9e931bd2a8f3fc08d347b77621d167998376385b9493ae26ec82c16ab3fe97", "ja": "それから、エミリーちゃんのスカート丈をもうすこし\n短くすると、並んだ時にバランスがいいと思うのです。", "zh": "然后把小艾蜜莉的裙长也缩短一点，\n站在一起时视觉上应该会比较平衡的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1039_102mis", "source_sha256": "a1360c5ab0aae58b58514dbb1ae078430549f33031ea0b320c9c8c3ffc6e880d", "ja": "え……ああっ、たしかに！\nそのほうが、バランスがよくなるかも！", "zh": "咦……啊，真的耶！\n这样看起来好像真的比较协调！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1040_102mis", "source_sha256": "c95719850c0fe3b9f7029e1f8a556f563e0248db3dc78decd8f3cc2b4a334372", "ja": "すごいなぁ、まつりちゃん。\nエミリーちゃんのこと、よく見てるんだね。", "zh": "茉莉好厉害啊，\n你很仔细观察艾蜜莉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1041_021mat", "source_sha256": "0f5a0230fa017a6012703a0ae267b465bcd5ce0192505b26ce558ac3b3821ec0", "ja": "当然なのです。まつりとエミリーちゃんは、\nデュオのユニットなのですから。", "zh": "这是当然的喔，\n因为茉莉和小艾蜜莉是双人组团体的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1042_032emi", "source_sha256": "1f03591182b2b6ebf41fc9b8d078e21b68e0102a9ffc81552ab9db1325f96842", "ja": "まつりさん……はっ！？\nもしかして、これが……？", "zh": "茉莉……啊！？\n这该不会就是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "eb333b1e6e5bea0416487711ed48c52956c86edbb5c675b786da1ce0b8c1e2ed", "ja": "ユニットのために、相手の事を考える……\nそれって、和の心なんじゃないかな？", "zh": "为了团体，为对方着想……\n这也许就是大和之心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "1279f3cd26910cccf6453a51ab332041eaf304d268feaf0c9301799c15396b35", "ja": "は、はい……そのとおりです！\nまつりさんは、なんと大和撫子なのでしょう……！", "zh": "是、是的……正是如此！\n茉莉真是充满了大和抚子的精神……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1045_032emi", "source_sha256": "39b2174e49c931851dcc185c7ec91e1db329f0e5c1ca0863e2602ade577b1e52", "ja": "私、今、わかりました……まつりさんと双子のように\n気持ちを重ねることが、大和撫子への道なのですね！", "zh": "我现在懂了……和茉莉像双胞胎一样互相理解，\n就是成为大和抚子之路吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1046_032emi", "source_sha256": "668991ca238cc445a2da173e8b84d4207d5dce7200aea7fa75665ec2e2921d0c", "ja": "まつりさん、美咲さん！\nわ、私にも拝見させてください……！", "zh": "茉莉、美咲！\n请、请让我也看看……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0070_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_05_1047_p", "source_sha256": "ab9ebabb6186eea2d417b0a7bd20c7275965caef38f69c551ebd6164a3ca6e1c", "ja": "（エミリーは、まつりの気持ちを理解したようだ。\nきっと、いいデュオになるだろう……ここからだな！）", "zh": "（艾蜜莉似乎了解茉莉的想法了，\n她们一定会成为很好的双人组……这里就是起点！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
